<title>SOUTH AFRICA: British agricultural engineers to visit S.Africa.</title>
<headline>British agricultural engineers to visit S.Africa.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A trade delegation of British agricultural engineers will visit South Africa for a ten day trade mission starting on March 10, the British Consulate-General in Johannesburg said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The delegates will visit Johannesburg, Durban and Cape Town to promote products including specialist agricultural fertilisers, chemicals, equipment for crop storage and computer software.</p>
<p>Twelve firms will be on the trip including Allied Colloids Plc and Massey Ferguson Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
